abstract: "A bilingual (English and Chinese) reading companion to the talk Studying the Human Mind with AI: a start page, a guide to each of the talk's four parts, 22 one-page cards on key readings, a glossary, a reading path, a field-wide list of checked references, a page on questions psychologists bring, a guide to working with AI researchers, a printable handout, and the slides of the talk as a PDF."
